{"id":"d585cbf989199162","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-partial-function.md","title":"Partial Function","display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-partial-function","aliases":["88-df-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — Partial Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> (candidate graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> (candidate input)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (partial-function-from-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-to-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\rightharpoonup B\">\\(f:A\\rightharpoonup B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\downarrow\">\\(f(x)\\downarrow\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\\uparrow\">\\(f(x)\\uparrow\\)</span> 是下述断言给出的记号；后两者是关于函数图定义域的公式缩写，不预先形成函数值项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y,z\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f\\to y=z\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y,z\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f\\to y=z\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n(f:A\\rightharpoonup B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n(f:A\\rightharpoonup B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(f(x)\\downarrow)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(f(x)\\downarrow)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow)&amp;\\coloneqq x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>收敛与发散记号由函数图的定义域解释，不需要给未定义的函数值指定默认值。</li>\n<li>No functionality or domain condition is assumed before the displayed\nequivalence; both are supplied by the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\rightharpoonup B","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"f(x)\\uparrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)\n\\leftrightarrow\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\n\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y,z\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f\\land\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in f\\to y=z\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n(f:A\\rightharpoonup B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(f(x)\\downarrow)&\\coloneqq x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow)&\\coloneqq x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1419,"backlinks":[{"id":"00bd6f946aa1721c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ (partial-function predicate, see [[88-df-partial-function]])"},{"id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7663d6a38dbde5cc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,A,B)$ (partial function, see [[88-df-partial-function]])"},{"id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialFunction}$ 见 [[88-df-partial-function]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_k$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"3f15ceb2e87b8f4f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mat